      "object_id": "mathia_interpretation_ac7b0fba6496ef6cdfa5a76a5727413e834606ceb38e6775a328e36430f2c613",
      "object_role": "interpretation",
      "proposed_content": "Symmetry is not decorative: it selects the numerical method. Recognizing evenness exposes a convergence regime in which the supposedly more sophisticated extrapolation is unnecessary, and nested grids make refinement values reusable across moments.",
