      "object_id": "mathia_synthesis_fe2683efa053fab74fd7115bbe80e7177ebbbd14b8f6edfee86299eac0334ac6",
      "object_role": "synthesis",
      "proposed_content": "The continuation procedure makes the least Jensen-polynomial degree with non-real roots the search output at each sampled parameter, and the table quantifies how that witness profile changes: the reported endpoint rises from degree 16 at parameter -50 with 28-digit arithmetic to degree 406 at -5 with 250-digit arithmetic. Together these observations indicate sharply increasing practical burden toward -5 for the implementation used.",
